 D28:2)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! It was an awesome feeling seeing everyone come together to celebrate - super rewarding! Look at this photo showcasing how wonderfully we spent our time!\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of people dancing at a party]\n[S28T3] (dia_id: D28:3)\n\nDave: Wow, great job, Calvin! Congrats! What was it like when everyone was cheering you on?\n[S28T4] (dia_id: D28:4)\n\nCalvin: It was incredible, Dave! The room was buzzing with energy and love. It was a powerful reminder of why I'm doing this.\n[Image caption: a photo of a group of people standing on top of a stage]\n[S28T5] (dia_id: D28:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Creating something that brings people together and inspires them - that's really awesome!\n[S28T6] (dia_id: D28:6)","text_sha256":"efb6c52f78c9be07eb4095cbb6ba753596edf4cfdb5f2a841edfbca34bbad3c1","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D15:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":33,"line_start":32,"source_locators":["[S15T7]"],"text_sha256":"6fdd00f6d22c42b30916db09b67f1b7b91602c88c418c7be550f3a045d4d4205"},{"dia_ids":["D15:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":36,"line_start":35,"source_locators":["[S15T8]"],"text_sha256":"64e0eeace93b6a1c739d8bf14528b557eee23e4d90c888a3787a3d1d820486b8"},{"dia_ids":["D15:9"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":39,"line_start":38,"source_locators":["[S15T9]"],"text_sha256":"d190482b2dafdddc94cbcea454f37effd8cb8f22f6836b8fb978b4ff7791e992"},{"dia_ids":["D15:10"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":42,"line_start":41,"source_locators":["[S15T10]"],"text_sha256":"d0138c592f6803bbfd4d5b7fde78e3feff0838eb6da37e173dd674b8ed3ff2d7"},{"dia_ids":["D15:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":45,"line_start":44,"source_locators":["[S15T11]"],"text_sha256":"a20f7918af3a3743c1134a14297b040487ac16fe9ea507c3adcc5508e69fc043"},{"dia_ids":["D15:12"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":48,"line_start":47,"source_locators":["