t was a dream come true, Dave! The festival had buzzing energy and a super upbeat crowd. We all felt connected, it was amazing!\n[S15T8] (dia_id: D15:8)\n\nDave: Sounds like you had a blast! Did any other collaborations come out of that performance? Any upcoming concerts we should know about?\n[S15T9] (dia_id: D15:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah Dave, someone even noticed my performance and now we're working together, which is wild. My tour ends soon and I'm heading to Boston. Maybe we can meet up then!\n[S15T10] (dia_id: D15:10)\n\nDave: Sounds great! Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!\n[S15T11] (dia_id: D15:11)\n\nCalvin: Of course, Dave can't wait to catch up! I almost forgot, yesterday my friends and I recorded a podcast where we discuss the rapidly evolving rap industry!\n[S15T12] (dia_id: D15:12)\n\nDave: That sounds fantastic! I'm looking forward to listening to your podcast and learning more about the rap industry. Keep up the great work!\n[S15T13] (dia_id: D15:13)\n\nCalvin: I'll let you know when the podcast will be uploaded. Take care!\n[S15T14] (dia_id: D15:14)\n\nDave: Sure, Calvin! Looking forward to hearing about it. See ya then!\n[S15T15] (dia_id: D15:15)","text_sha256":"173ab196144fca76cb4f49a88a2cfac2f354f6eb4f4daa02e3497bebb9a523b6","timestamp":"2023-08-22T11:06:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":1165,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":15686,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":16851},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c